{"qid": "tt_t1_00007", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 48.25, "n_tokens": 221, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 332, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "简短结论：**不能直接以《合同法》第二百一十一条作为你2026年起诉的请求权依据**，理由有两点：一是该条已被《民法典》取代而失效，二是你所述情形（约定月利率1%）本身也不属于该条调整的“没有约定或约定不明确”的情形。\n\n**一、法律依据已变更**\n\n《中华人民共和国合同法》已于2021年1月1日随《中华人民共和国民法典》施行而废止（《民法典》第一千二百六十条明确列举废止的法律包括《合同法》）。因此，2026年起诉时，法院不会以《合同法》第二百一十一条作为裁判依据。\n\n你所引用的规则，现由《民法典》第六百八十条第二款、第三款承继：\n\n- 《民法典》第六百八十条第二款：借款合同对支付利息没有约定的，视为没有利息。\n- 《民法典》第六百八十条第三款：借款合同对", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.047, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）沪01民再1266号_0", "score": 0.7514, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）沪01民再1266号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）浙01民初2525号_1", "score": 0.2573, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）浙01民初2525号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏05民再1869号_1", "score": 0.2538, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏05民再1869号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民再1226号_1", "score": 0.2538, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民再1226号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2114号_1", "score": 0.2538, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2114号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）鲁01民终1270号_1", "score": 0.2538, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（