{"qid": "tt_t2_00001", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 44.05, "n_tokens": 228, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.76, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 343, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "不能按原样理解了。该条文已被 2023 年修订的《公司法》取代，现行有效的是 2023 年修订、自 2024 年 7 月 1 日起施行的《公司法》。\n\n**一、旧法（2018修正）第二十六条**\n原文仅规定：有限责任公司的注册资本为在公司登记机关登记的全体股东认缴的出资额。当时对认缴出资的缴足期限没有法定上限，由公司章程自行约定，实践中出现大量\"认缴期限几十年\"的情形。\n\n**二、现行法（2023修订）第四十七条**\n现行《公司法》第四十七条规定：有限责任公司的注册资本为在公司登记机关登记的全体股东认缴的出资额。**全体股东认缴的出资额由股东按照公司章程的规定自公司成立之日起五年内缴足。** 法律、行政法规以及国务院决定对有限责任公司注册资本实缴、注册资本最低限额、股东出资期限", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.043, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_公司法(2018修正)_2018修正_26", "score": 0.9113, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法(2018修正)", "article": 26, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_47", "score": 0.5338, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 47, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_49", "score": 0.3033, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 49, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_51", "score": 0.2012, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 51, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_88", "score": 0.1997, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 88, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）粤03民终621号_0", "score": 0.1695, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）粤03民终621号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪02民终1495号_0", "score": 0.1691, "type": "