{"qid": "tt_t2_00007", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 38.04, "n_tokens": 218, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.44, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 327, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "结论：**不建议在起诉状中直接引用《合同法》第一百九十六条。** 该条文所规范的内容现已被《民法典》第六百六十七条吸收，且《合同法》已随《民法典》施行而废止。\n\n具体说明：\n\n1. **条文内容本身仍可这样理解。** 《民法典》第六百六十七条规定：“借款合同是借款人向贷款人借款，到期返还借款并支付利息的合同。”这与原《合同法》第一百九十六条的表述完全一致，含义未变。\n\n2. **但引用时应更新法律依据。** 自2021年1月1日《民法典》施行后，《合同法》同时废止（参见《民法典》第一千二百六十条）。因此，起诉状中援引借款合同定义时，应写**《中华人民共和国民法典》第六百六十七条**，而非《合同法》第一百九十六条。\n\n3. **起诉状中可一并援引的", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.037, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_196", "score": 0.8774, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 196, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_667", "score": 0.5825, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 667, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_668", "score": 0.1835, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 668, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初493号_1", "score": 0.1039, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初493号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）浙01民初902号_1", "score": 0.1039, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）浙01民初902号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民再1968号_1", "score": 0.1039, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）津02民再1968号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民初2221号_1", "score": 0.1