{"qid": "tt_t2_00019", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 42.14, "n_tokens": 222, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["公司法(2018修正)"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.68, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 333, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['公司法(2018修正)'] tvc=0", "answer": "不能按原条文单独理解并直接写进起诉状，需要区分适用时点。\n\n**要点如下：**\n\n1. **《公司法(2018修正)》第二十六条**的表述是“有限责任公司的注册资本为在公司登记机关登记的全体股东认缴的出资额”，该条本身**未规定五年缴足期限**。\n\n2. 但现行《公司法》**第四十七条**已规定：全体股东认缴的出资额由股东按照公司章程的规定**自公司成立之日起五年内缴足**；法律、行政法规以及国务院决定另有规定的，适用其规定。\n\n3. 因此，若你起诉所涉公司**成立于2024年7月1日之后**，或属于依现行法应适用五年缴足规则的情形，仅引用《公司法(2018修正)》第二十六条来论证“认缴即可、无期限限制”是不准确的，应结合**现行《公司法》第四十七条**表述", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.041, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_公司法(2018修正)_2018修正_26", "score": 0.9038, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法(2018修正)", "article": 26, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_47", "score": 0.5348, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 47, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_49", "score": 0.3047, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 49, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_51", "score": 0.2034, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 51, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_88", "score": 0.1935, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 88, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_53", "score": 0.1704, "type": "provision", "law": "公司法", "article": 53, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_公司法_2023修订_52", "score": 0.1671, "type": "provi