{"qid": "tt_t2_00025", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 34.86, "n_tokens": 227, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.52, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 341, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "《合同法》第一百九十六条的条文原文本身表述无误，但**该法已自2021年1月1日起随《民法典》施行而废止**，因此现在不能再以\"《合同法》第一百九十六条\"作为现行有效的法律依据来援引。\n\n就条文内容的理解而言，现行《民法典》第六百六十七条作了**完全相同**的规定：\"借款合同是借款人向贷款人借款，到期返还借款并支付利息的合同。\"所以：\n\n1. **实质理解不变**：借款合同的核心仍是\"借款—到期返还本金—支付利息\"。\n2. **援引依据应更新**：现在应引用《民法典》第六百六十七条，而非《合同法》第一百九十六条。\n3. **相关配套规定**：借款合同的形式与内容见《民法典》第六百六十八条（应采用书面形式，自然人之间借款另有约定的除外）；利息支付期限见《民法典》第六百七十四条", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.034, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_196", "score": 0.8906, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 196, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_667", "score": 0.6061, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 667, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_674", "score": 0.2174, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 674, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_668", "score": 0.202, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 668, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初493号_1", "score": 0.1244, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初493号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）浙01民初902号_1", "score": 0.1244, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）浙01民初902号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民再1968号_1", "score": 0.12