{"qid": "tt_t3_00013", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 31.12, "n_tokens": 208, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["物权法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.28, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 313, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['物权法'] tvc=0", "answer": "《物权法》现已失效，不再作为独立法律适用。\n\n《中华人民共和国物权法》自2007年10月1日起施行，后被《中华人民共和国民法典》吸收整合。根据《民法典》第一千二百六十条的规定，民法典自2021年1月1日起施行，《物权法》等九部法律同时废止。\n\n因此，自2021年1月1日起，涉及物权的问题应适用《民法典》物权编的相关规定。例如：\n\n- 原《物权法》第九条关于不动产物权登记生效的规定，现对应《民法典》第二百零九条；\n- 原《物权法》第三十九条关于所有权权能的规定，现对应《民法典》第二百四十条。\n\n需要说明的是，上述条号对应关系是基于法律编纂的一般情况，如需在具体案件或文书中引用，建议核对《民法典》相应条文原文，以确保准确。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.03, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_物权法_2007_39", "score": 0.6682, "type": "provision", "law": "物权法", "article": 39, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_物权法_2007_9", "score": 0.6287, "type": "provision", "law": "物权法", "article": 9, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_497", "score": 0.1214, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 497, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_1", "score": 0.1194, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_1", "score": 0.1194, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民再1989号_1", "score": 0.1192, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）津02民再1989号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民终1939号_1", "score": 0.1192, "type": "judgm